:: CornerStore [nobr]
<<HUD>>
<<set $luckyMartVisits += 1>>

<<if not $metLuis>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>The corner store on the ground floor of a building that&apos;s seen better decades. Fluorescent lights, a bell over the door that&apos;s lost half its ring, lottery ticket ads curling in the window.</p>
<p>Behind the register: a man in his forties, neat mustache, warm brown eyes, a plain polo with a name tag that reads <strong>LUIS</strong>. A newspaper is open in front of him. He looks up.</p>
</div>
<<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "Hey there, what can I get you?" "">>
<<set $metLuis to true>>
<<else>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>Same bell, same fluorescent hum. Luis looks up from his newspaper.</p>
</div>
<<set _rbGreet to window.rbRandom(1, $luckyMartVisits >= 5 ? 4 : 3)>>
<<switch _rbGreet>>
<<case 1>><<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "Morning, sweetheart." "">>
<<case 2>><<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "Hey there, what can I get you?" "">>
<<case 3>><<if $player.att gte 30>><<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "You look nice today." "">><<else>><<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "Cold enough for you?" "">><</if>>
<<case 4>><<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "The usual?" "">>
<</switch>>
<</if>>

<div class="action-list">

<<if $player.money gte 2>>
	<<link '<span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a candy bar<span class="action-sub">A little sugar, a little stupid</span></span><span class="action-cost">$2</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<run window.rbSpend(2, "snack")>>
		<<set $player.energy to Math.clamp($player.energy + 6, 0, 100)>>
		<<set $player.stress to Math.clamp($player.stress - 2, 0, 100)>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<div class="action-btn action-locked"><span class="action-icon">🍫</span><span class="action-text">Buy a candy bar<span class="action-sub">You&apos;re $2 short</span></span></div>
<</if>>

<<link '<span class="action-icon">💬</span><span class="action-text">Make small talk with Luis<span class="action-sub">He&apos;s always got something to say</span></span>' "CornerStore_SmallTalk">><</link>>

<<link '<span class="action-icon">👀</span><span class="action-text">Just look around<span class="action-sub">Window shopping, apparently, applies to gas station snacks too</span></span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>

</div>

<<if $day is 2 and not $metCarmenStore and window.rbRandom(1, 10) lte 4>>

<<SceneDivider "The Aisle Collision">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>I round the corner of aisle 3 and nearly collide with another customer. She&apos;s my age   maybe a year older   with dark curly hair, a State University hoodie, and a basket full of what appears to be exclusively Hot Pockets and wine.</p>
<p>&quot;Oh! Sorry!&quot; She steadies her basket. One of the Hot Pockets makes a break for it   I catch it before it hits the floor.</p>
</div>

<<Dialogue "Carmen" "🎓" "Nice reflexes. I'm Carmen. Not the lingerie Carmen — I don't know any lingerie Carmen, that would be weird. Just... Carmen." "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Aida." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Carmen" "🎓" "Cool name. You go to State? I feel like I've seen you around." "">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>She hasn&apos;t. She&apos;s never seen me because I didn&apos;t exist before Thursday. But her face is open and friendly and she&apos;s the first person my age who&apos;s spoken to me since the transformation who isn&apos;t a medical professional or a delivery customer.</p>
</div>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Yeah. Second year." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Carmen" "🎓" "Me too! We should study together sometime. I'm pre-law and I'm dying. Like, actively dying. Torts are killing me." "">>

<div class="prose-block">
<p>She scribbles her number on the back of a Hot Pocket box, tears off the flap, and hands it to me. &quot;Text me! Or don&apos;t. No pressure. But seriously, torts. I need help.&quot;</p>
<p>She waves and disappears around the pasta sauce. I stand there holding a piece of cardboard with a phone number on it, written in purple ink, smelling faintly of pepperoni.</p>
<p>I just made a friend. I think. Do women make friends this fast? Is this how it works?</p>
</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🍬 Keep shopping</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<set $metCarmenStore to true>>
		<<run window.rbAddMilestone("Made a friend at the corner store. Maybe.")>>
	<</link>>
</div>

<<elseif $luckyMartVisits gte 2>>
<<set _rbEnc to window.rbRandom(1, 10)>>
<<if _rbEnc lte 4>>

<<SceneDivider "In the Aisles">>

<<switch _rbEnc>>

<<case 1 2>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A woman with a toddler on her hip is stretching for something on the top shelf, the kid wailing at a pitch that could strip paint.</p>
</div>
<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🙋 Reach it for her</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<set $player.con to Math.clamp($player.con + 1, 0, 100)>>
		<<run window.rbAddJournalEntry("Small Kindness", "Helped a mom reach a shelf at Lucky Mart. She thanked me like I'd done something bigger than that.")>>
	<</link>>
	<<link '<span>🚶 Keep to your own aisle</span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>
</div>

<<case 3>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A teenage stockboy is restocking shelves nearby. He glances over, sees you, drops a can. It rolls under the shelf. He doesn&apos;t chase it.</p>
<p><em>He&apos;s a child. I feel old and I&apos;m twenty.</em></p>
</div>
<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🙂 Smile and move on</span>' "CornerStore">><</link>>
</div>

<<case 4>>
<div class="prose-block">
<p>A guy in a hoodie is lingering by the beer cooler, glancing over every few seconds like he&apos;s working up the nerve to say something. He never does. You check out and leave. He&apos;s still standing there.</p>
</div>

<</switch>>

<</if>>
<</if>>

<div class="choice-block" style="margin-top:2rem;">
	<<link '<span>← Back outside</span>' "Outside">><</link>>
</div>

:: CornerStore_SmallTalk [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<<if not $knowsBeanSoupRecipe>>
<<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "You eating enough? You always buy ramen. Let me tell you something   my wife makes a bean soup that costs less than ramen and tastes like God's kitchen. You want the recipe?" "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "I... yeah. Actually, yes." "you">>
<p>He writes it on the back of a receipt, unprompted pride in his handwriting.</p>
<<else>>
<<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "They say rain tomorrow. You got an umbrella?" "">>
<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "No." "you">>
<<Dialogue "Luis" "🧔" "Aisle 3, bottom shelf. Eight bucks. Worth it." "">>
<</if>>

</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>← Back to the counter</span>' "CornerStore">>
		<<if not $knowsBeanSoupRecipe>>
			<<set $knowsBeanSoupRecipe to true>>
			<<run window.rbAddMilestone("Learned Luis's bean soup recipe.")>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $player.stress to Math.clamp($player.stress - 2, 0, 100)>>
	<</link>>
</div>
